  <prompt>Deploy the @spaarke/visuals-backed VisualHost to dev and confirm every visual renders identically to before the extraction, including dark mode and drill-through.</prompt>
  <role>QA / deployment engineer</role>
  <goal>Post-extraction VisualHost deployed to dev with full visual + drill-through parity in light and dark.</goal>
  <constraints>
    <constraint source="project">Dev only; owner confirmation before import.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-021">Dark-mode via semantic tokens — verify all visuals.</constraint>
  </constraints>
  <knowledge>
    <files>
      <file>docs/guides/PCF-DEPLOYMENT-GUIDE.md</file>
